  "answer": "The account executive should correct the prospect: NovaLearn does **not** delete all customer data immediately on request as a standard practice. The official policy in `[NL-007-S06]` is the sole authority for deletion timelines. Under the standard policy, after contract termination the workspace is suspended for 30 days, permanent deletion from active databases and primary storage is completed within 60 days of suspension (90 days total from contract termination), and full cryptographic erasure including cold storage backups is completed within 120 days of contract termination.\n\nQualification: Immediate or faster deletion is not standard. Enterprise customers may negotiate custom deletion timelines (for example, a 30-day active purge and 60-day backup purge, or even a 7-day deletion), but such terms must be explicitly documented in a signed Data Processing Agreement (DPA) and configured by the engineering operations team `[NL-007-S06]`. Sales claims of immediate deletion are therefore out-of-scope informal claims and should not be relied on `[NL-019-S05]`; the account executive should direct the prospect to the official policy and offer a custom DPA if the prospect needs accelerated deletion `[NL-032-S06]`.\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
